{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267deKAWWQlj1795412985.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國旺旺中期少賺近四成，截至9月底半年，純利10.3億元人民幣，維持不派中期息。期內收入100億元人民幣，減少百分之9。毛利率下跌1.5個百分點，至百分之44.7，主要受主要產品銷量下滑，推高運營成本等影響。</p><p></p><p>集團預期，下半財年銷售持續下行，將繼續推出措施，令銷售節奏穩步進行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:51:24.647107+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:27:32.723532+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:44:50.874232+00:00","content_hash":"ce4c2e5fc55c6c74a714f3ba8fafed07fb02f25ee7a23a8bed5eefbe4be8b6af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:51:24.647107+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}